# DS tokens & styles — hard bans

Companion to `bricks-ds-all-tokens` + `bricks-ds-color-bible` (Bricks **v1.2.0**).

## All values

- Colors, **radius (rounded)**, **spacing**, **font/type**, and **text styles** must map to Bricks DS tokens / library bindings only.
- **Never** hardcode px/hex/font stacks that bypass tokens.

## Variables & text styles

- **Never create** new Figma **variables** unless the user explicitly asks to extend the DS.
- **Never create** new Figma **text styles** (or text-style variables).
- Reuse **Bricks Design System** library variables and text styles only.

## Figma CLI / canvas

No raw fills/sizes/radii, no `variables.create`, no `createTextStyle`. Import/bind from Bricks library only.
